  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Abu Abdillah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAH \nPeace be upon you, O Son of the Messenger of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERAL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O Son of the Commander of the Faithful,\nوَابْنَ سَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ\nWABNA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA, \nAnd the Son of the Master of the Successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ فَاطِمَۃَ الزَّهْرَآءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O Son of Fatima al-Zahra, \nسَیِّدَۃِ نِسَاءِ الْعٰلَمِیْنَ\nSAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEEN \nThe Mistress of the Women of the Worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ وَ عَلٰی جَدِّكَ وَ اَبِیْكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA JADDEKA WA ABEEKA\nPeace be upon you and upon your grandfather and your father. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ وَ عَلٰی اُمِّكَ وَ اَخِیْكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA UMMEKA WA AKHEEKA\nPeace be upon you and upon your mother and your brother. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ وَ عَلٰی تِسْعَۃِ الْمَعْصُوْمِیْنَ مِنْ ذُرِّیَّتِكَ وَ بَنِیْكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA TIS-A’TIL MA’SOOMEENA MIN ZURRIYATEKA WA BANEEKA\nPeace be upon you and upon the nine Infallibles from your progeny and your sons. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكُمْ یَا سَادَاتِیْ جَمِیْعًا وَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA SAADAATEE JAMEE-A’N WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOH.\nPeace be upon you, O my Masters, all of you, and the Mercy of Allah and His Blessings.",
